  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2601.03 Type of Permits and Licenses. This chapter governs the following permits and licenses:\n\n(a) Permits and licenses for the sale of display and consumer fireworks pursuant to RSA 160-B:6; and\n\n(b) Permits and licenses for the sale of permissible fireworks pursuant to RSA 160-C:3.\n\nSource. #4983, eff 11-16-90; ss by INTERIM #6362, eff 11-16-96, EXPIRES: 3-16-97; ss by #6459, eff 2-20-97; ss by #7905, eff 6-24-03; ss by #8519, eff 12-16-05; ss by #10784, eff 2-13-15",
